    {
      "id": "claim_d913fb7e03eb4442999eb7026f7c1501",
      "statement": "Assembly is emit-only and never invokes podman — `harnessed-tools` only reads the catalog and writes the profile under --build-dir, with the host running `podman build` on the emitted artifacts — so only the launcher (and volumes, which it drives) touch the container runtime.",
      "evidence": [
