    {
      "id": "claim_af52536ba9b44b439f0c8e0fc1ed66d4",
      "statement": "`launcher.main` treats the leading CLI token as a subcommand, full stop — the old `_COMMANDS`-based bare-stack shorthand is gone because every newly registered verb silently became unreachable under it — so a stack is named by `--stack`/`--recipe` and the harness is the leading positional of the verb.",
