      "statement": "`install.sh` installs the CLI from a pinned git tag (v0.1.0, a placeholder — no release tag exists yet), detects podman and uv but refuses to run anything privileged (no sudo, no package-manager writes, no podman auto-install; `--install-uv` is the sole opt-in user-space exception), and `--uninstall` removes only the CLI while preserving ~/.config/harnessed and $XDG_DATA_HOME/harnessed.",
