      "statement": "`HARNESSED_PODMAN=1 uv run pytest tests/test_recipes_integration.py` is the live gate: it builds each catalog stack for real and asserts every declared skill/command/plugin/MCP server is present in the running container, covering a newly added stack automatically, and doubling as the documented way to verify a host against the podman reference runtime.",
