    {
      "id": "claim_98cafa3a39e247faa173fd2abe3e1e5b",
      "statement": "The capability test's output is printed, never written to a file: `report.emit` renders the rich markdown capability table to the terminal (or the structured JSON on plain stdout under `--json`) and returns `report.exit_code`, so the same single `CapabilityReport` drives both the human view and the process exit code. The README's statement that the report is written to `$XDG_DATA_HOME/harnessed/profiles/<stack>/<harness>/capability-report.md` does not match the code.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/harnessed/cli.py#L181-L201",
