    {
      "id": "claim_9c77c1c4af4e42a3b4c44c178beec43b",
      "statement": "`container-run` and `host-run` choose their stack through the same `launcher._resolve_stack` call (`--stack`, a `--recipe` set, or the `default` baseline with neither) and differ only in backend, never in how a stack is chosen; the shared call site is also where the first-run seeding of the user's default recipe happens so the two backends stay in step.",
